@Dante There has been no update since the last comment on June 17. Could you please share the current status of the STAG environment data exposure issue fix, and the expected timeline for when this Meal Basis task will be completed?

As mentioned in previous comments, this request has been **continuously receiving complaints from hotels via the KR SCM team**, and it has been flagged as a Priority: High request (BTBS-295). This task should have been picked up immediately after the Hotel List project deployment, but it has already been significantly delayed. A fast resolution of the fix and QA is needed.

Please share an update on the progress. Thank you. //cc. @Tracy2

@Tracy In the Ellis system, we do not show the number of breakfasts. We only show whether breakfast is included or not.

In this case, the system correctly returned that breakfast was included. However, to handle this scenario more accurately, we recommend adding an additional validation based on the number of guests and the number of breakfasts provided by the supplier.

Only when the number of breakfasts is greater than or equal to the number of guests should the room be displayed as **Free Breakfast**.
